  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1585\">\n<li data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1287\">\n<p data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1287\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1227\">ZN Stain:</strong> Direct smear for Acid-Fast Bacilli; rapid screening for TB.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1364\">\n<p data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1364\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1313\">AFB Culture (MGIT):</strong> More sensitive than smear; detects viable bacilli.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1492\">\n<p data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1492\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1387\">Differentiation:</strong> Identifies whether AFB are <em data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1451\">Mycobacterium tuberculosis complex</em> or <em data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1491\">Non-Tuberculous Mycobacteria (NTM)</em>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1585\">\n<p data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1585\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1503\">PCR:</strong> Rapid molecular detection of <em data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1550\">M. tuberculosis</em> DNA, even in smear-negative cases.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1785\">\n<p data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1785\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">A <strong data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1612\">negative result</strong> in all parameters suggests no evidence of active mycobacterial infection.</span><br data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1689\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">A <strong data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1723\">positive PCR or culture</strong> requires clinical correlation and public health notification</span></p>\n</blockquote>",
